      "writtenOn": "2024-08-13T00:14:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We don\u0027t yet provide explicit support for rewinding the input stream.  I imagine that this may require recreating `fReader`.\n\nI assume that this is fine - we can get there once we enable enough test coverage to get test failures (and I assume that we will get test failures if rewinding is needed for Blink;  it seems that all `//ui/gfx` tests pass without rewinding support).",
